<SiteLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for the Kroma Digital website.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Website privacy information for Kroma Digital.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="wrap prose"><p><strong>Last updated: August 20, 2026</strong></p><h2>1. Scope</h2><p>This Privacy Policy applies to the Kroma Digital website. Individual Kroma Digital applications may have their own privacy policies describing the data practices of those products.</p><h2>2. Information we receive</h2><p>This website does not currently provide account registration or an on-site contact form. If you contact Kroma Digital through an external service such as Facebook, information you provide through that service is also subject to that service's privacy practices.</p><h2>3. Technical information</h2><p>Our hosting and infrastructure providers may process ordinary technical information needed to deliver and protect the website, such as IP addresses, request information, security signals, and basic traffic data.</p><h2>4. How information is used</h2><p>Information received by Kroma Digital may be used to respond to inquiries, understand user needs, improve products and services, maintain security, and comply with applicable legal obligations.</p><h2>5. Sharing</h2><p>Kroma Digital does not sell personal information. Information may be processed by service providers where necessary to operate communications, hosting, security, or other business functions, or disclosed where required by law.</p><h2>6. External links</h2><p>This website may link to third-party services. Their handling of information is governed by their own terms and privacy policies.</p><h2>7. Changes</h2><p>We may update this policy as the website and our services change. The latest version will be published on this page with an updated date.</p><h2>8. Contact</h2><p>Questions about this policy can be sent through the Kroma Digital Facebook page linked on our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p></div></section>
</SiteLayout>